flowchart TD
	A([Start: Select RAG Architecture]) --> B{Need continuity across
	user sessions?}

	B -->|Yes| M[Memory RAG]
	B -->|No| C{Primary data includes
	images, charts, tables,
	scanned PDFs?}

	C -->|Yes| MM[Multimodal RAG]
	C -->|No| D{Need strict joins,
	metrics, or database truth?}

	D -->|Yes| S[Structured-Data RAG
	Text-to-SQL + docs]
	D -->|No| E{Need entity + relationship
	reasoning across sources?}

	E -->|Yes| F{Need global thematic
	synthesis across many docs?}
	E -->|No| G{Are queries often vague
	or underspecified?}

	F -->|Yes| GR[GraphRAG]
	F -->|No| H[Hybrid RAG
	Knowledge Graph + Vector]

	G -->|Yes| I{Want one-shot expansion
	or multi-rewrite retrieval?}
	G -->|No| J{Need adaptive tool use,
	planning, and actions?}

	I -->|One-shot query expansion| HY[HyDE]
	I -->|Multiple rewrites + fusion| RF[RAG-Fusion]

	J -->|Yes| AR[Agentic RAG]
	J -->|No| K{Is corpus freshness
	time-critical?}

	K -->|Yes| T[Temporal or Streaming RAG]
	K -->|No| L{Need retrieval self-check
	and fallback correction?}

	L -->|Yes| CR[CRAG]
	L -->|No| N{Need model to decide
	when to retrieve?}

	N -->|Yes| SR[Self-RAG]
	N -->|No| O{Long documents require
	multi-level abstraction?}

	O -->|Yes| R[RAPTOR]
	O -->|No| P{Need precise chunk hit
	with larger section context?}

	P -->|Yes| PC[Parent-Child RAG]
	P -->|No| V[Vector Search RAG
	Baseline]